{"data": [{"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:50:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118038207757701285"], "id": "2118038207757701285", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 6875, "like_count": 104, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Who she would we blame?\n\nRight, the official who spearheaded every actual foreign policy success the administration has had\n\nBut never our hapless drunk WARRIOR secretary who pushed for a war with zero plan https://t.co/wmGiwG7tiv", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/dailymail/stat…", "end": 230, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/dailymail/status/2117898995662000474", "start": 207, "url": "https://t.co/wmGiwG7tiv"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117898995662000474", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118038207757701285"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:40:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118035579334193507"], "id": "2118035579334193507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1532, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "corruption and cost of living\n\n(and cost of living includes gas prices, which is Iran war in a gas price trenchcoat) https://t.co/vBwGdGwSyx", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TimAlberta/sta…", "end": 140, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TimAlberta/status/2118016087224983872", "start": 117, "url": "https://t.co/vBwGdGwSyx"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118016087224983872", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118035579334193507"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:34:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118034216503955710"], "id": "2118034216503955710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 121, "impression_count": 473120, "like_count": 2592, "quote_count": 32, "reply_count": 127, "retweet_count": 360}, "text": "Join us for @astro_anil and @astro_kutryk’s next spacewalk!\n\nTune in here on Nov. 5 at 8:30am ET (1330 UTC) to watch the astronauts install and deploy the second of two new solar arrays on the @Space_Station. https://t.co/a1V5ciNgfD", "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 23, "id": "1456357980216066048", "start": 12, "username": "astro_anil"}, {"end": 41, "id": "798240312908910593", "start": 28, "username": "Astro_Kutryk"}, {"end": 207, "id": "1451773004", "start": 193, "username": "Space_Station"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/a1V5ciNgfD", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118034216503955710/video/1", "media_key": "13_2118034167816466432", "start": 209, "url": "https://t.co/a1V5ciNgfD"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118034216503955710"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:27:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118032440002265326"], "id": "2118032440002265326", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1763, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "America will not tolerate higher cost of living. https://t.co/Jr0VocNcI1", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RyanSaavedra/s…", "end": 72, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RyanSaavedra/status/2117867437442179453", "start": 49, "url": "https://t.co/Jr0VocNcI1"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117867437442179453", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118032440002265326"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:26:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118032211404591303"], "id": "2118032211404591303", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2442, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I read it more specifically as throwing Pete Hegseth under the bus. https://t.co/gdtZEIyD2c", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mattyglesias/s…", "end": 91, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mattyglesias/status/2118021667301503031", "start": 68, "url": "https://t.co/gdtZEIyD2c"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118021667301503031", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118032211404591303"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:17:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118029836622913536"], "id": "2118029836622913536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3028, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "but hey, we gained 2 points with the 65+ crowd https://t.co/HktivUnmWp", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/CharlesFLehman…", "end": 70, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/CharlesFLehman/status/2118002438485766384", "start": 47, "url": "https://t.co/HktivUnmWp"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118002438485766384", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118029836622913536"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:12:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118028593682874588"], "id": "2118028593682874588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 10180, "like_count": 156, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "The only plausible path to victory in Iran is massive nuclear weapon use on civilian population centers followed by a demand for total regime change or else millions more will die. This is what we actually did to Japan. This strategy works.\n\nBut we should not do this. Which means", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118028593682874588"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:06:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118027032181502457"], "id": "2118027032181502457", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 5205, "like_count": 58, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "when i first saw this add, i assumed it was for a Republican https://t.co/muFODf8SW0", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/scott_colom/st…", "end": 84, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/scott_colom/status/2110149942727553187", "start": 61, "url": "https://t.co/muFODf8SW0"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110149942727553187", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118027032181502457"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:01:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118025830366695597"], "id": "2118025830366695597", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2497, "like_count": 92, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Corruption is a big issue!\n\nI'll say that for me personally, worries about this issue impacted my family's conversation about who we would vote for. \n\nThe fact that GOP electeds are not seeking penalties against obviously corrupt officials is nuts! https://t.co/nwi5PxHOIF", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RAVerBruggen/s…", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RAVerBruggen/status/2117985945840763272", "start": 249, "url": "https://t.co/nwi5PxHOIF"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117985945840763272", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118025830366695597"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:30:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118018169658843372"], "id": "2118018169658843372", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 189, "impression_count": 90537, "like_count": 2146, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 216}, "text": "Sanders-endorsed candidates outperformed 2024 Democratic shares by about 5-6%.\n\nNon-Sanders-endorsed candidates outperformed 2024 Democratic shares by about 14%.\n\nPeople voted against Trump. They very much did not vote for the DSA. https://t.co/BO8oMC4De5", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/trumwill/statu…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/trumwill/status/2118016068837101726", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/BO8oMC4De5"}]}, "refer